//!
//! Provides:
//!   POST   /api/gemma/chat                 — SSE stream to Ollama
//!   GET    /api/gemma/gallery              — list generated specs
//!   POST   /api/gemma/gallery              — append specs
//!   DELETE /api/gemma/gallery/:id          — remove spec
//!   GET    /api/gemma/catalog              — list promoted entries
//!   POST   /api/gemma/catalog/promote/:id  — promote from gallery
//!   DELETE /api/gemma/catalog/:id          — remove catalog entry
//!   PATCH  /api/gemma/catalog/:id          — update label/tags
//!   GET    /api/gemma/json-render-docs     — embedded authoring reference
//!   GET    /api/gemma/plugin-schema/:plugin — JSON schema from SHM blob
//!   GET    /api/gemma/plugin-proto/:plugin — TEXT proto for Lovable codegen
//!   GET    /api/gemma/all-plugin-protos    — all active plugins as TEXT proto

